"id": "b7a05a8", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>We respect your privacy and only collect the information we need to make our website work better for you.</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-p", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "130499b", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>We do not sell, rent, or share your personal data with third parties for marketing.</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-p", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "a8e5852", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Here's what we do:</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-p", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "f8efe8e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<ul><li>We collect information only by fair and lawful means.</li><li>We explain why we collect it before or when we do.</li><li>We use it only for the reason we collected it.</li><li>We keep it safe and protect it from unauthorised access.</li><li>We keep it only for as long as needed to serve you better.</li></ul>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-bullets", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "53b5cac", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"flex_direction": "column", "flex_wrap": "nowrap", "content_width": "full", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 12, "column": "12", "row": "12", "isLinked": true}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "css_classes": "sw-legal-section"}, "elements": [{"id": "959df44", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Cookies: what they are", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-h", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=swh3", "title_color": "globals/colors?id=swheading"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "6ff6728", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Like most websites, we use cookies.</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-p", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "56b34af", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device that help the website remember your preferences and improve your browsing experience.</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-p", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "107bda6", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Some cookies are essential for the website to work, while others help us understand how visitors use our site.</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-p", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "2093cbc", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"flex_direction": "column", "flex_wrap": "nowrap", "content_width": "full", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 12, "column": "12", "row": "12", "isLinked": true}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "css_classes": "sw-legal-section"}, "elements": [{"id": "0e24813", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "How we use cookies", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-h", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=swh3", "title_color": "globals/colors?id=swheading"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "1287617", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>These cookies help us make our website more useful and relevant to you. We use cookies to:</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-p", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "104ebe7", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<ul><li>Remember your settings and preferences (like language or login).</li><li>Improve website performance and user experience.</li><li>Understand how visitors interact with our site using analytics tools.</li></ul>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-bullets", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "9948cf8", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"flex_direction": "column", "flex_wrap": "nowrap", "content_width": "full", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 12, "column": "12", "row": "12", "isLinked": true}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "css_classes": "sw-legal-section"}, "elements": [{"id": "d5b0b5c", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Managing or turning off cookies", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-h", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=swh3", "title_color": "globals/colors?id=swheading"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "bc3be86", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>You can choose to accept or reject cookies through your browser settings.</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-p", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "ebffbef", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>If you turn them off, some parts of the site may not work properly, but you'll still be able to browse most of it.</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-p", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "b806121", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>You can learn how to manage cookies in your browser's Help section.</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-p", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "e63e02e", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"flex_direction": "column", "flex_wrap": "nowrap", "content_width": "full", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 12, "column": "12", "row": "12", "isLinked": true}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "css_classes": "sw-legal-section"}, "elements": [{"id": "a7f721b", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Third-party cookies", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-h", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=swh3", "title_color": "globals/colors?id=swheading"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "65d6339", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>We may use trusted third-party tools like Google Analytics to understand how visitors use our website and improve our services.</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-p", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "de253cc", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>These tools collect anonymous usage data, not your personal details. You can learn more at the official Google Analytics privacy page.</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-p", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements"